# version-guard exemptions — one entry per line, '#' starts a comment.
# Two forms:
#   name          — full skip (all checks), for plugins whose versioning
#                   genuinely cannot follow the policy. Every entry needs
#                   a justification comment.
#   name @ <ref>  — grandfather: pre-policy history before <ref> is
#                   ignored for source attribution and the bump count;
#                   all other checks stay active. AUTO-LAPSES once the
#                   comparison base descends from <ref> (the guard prints
#                   a note, never fails) — no manual cleanup required.
#
# --- legacy pre-policy violations on main. Anchor: main tip right
# --- before the policy landed; these lapse automatically at the first
# --- post-policy tag and may then be deleted as optional housekeeping.
gpustack-ai-proxy            @ d446a8d225d5ff66a95f226b8a2c5e16df6d71ab  # 2 bumps predate the policy
gpustack-lb-decision-service @ d446a8d225d5ff66a95f226b8a2c5e16df6d71ab  # source change predates the policy
gpustack-lb-least-load       @ d446a8d225d5ff66a95f226b8a2c5e16df6d71ab  # source change predates the policy
gpustack-lb-session-affinity @ d446a8d225d5ff66a95f226b8a2c5e16df6d71ab  # source change predates the policy
